reading: a NEGATIVE delta is a saving on the tape alone, before any change to the contract
that would have to describe the new separator, and before any effect on the body. The
separator is inserted once per entry, so a saving is not a deletion: the entry count is
unchanged and the parse is unambiguous either way, because an entry still begins at the
first appearance of each glyph.
